		<item>
			<title>BLACK SUGAR TRANSMISSION Covers MADONNA's Debut Album (preview)</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/26275-andee-blacksugar/videos/video/33-black-sugar-transmission-covers-madonnas-debut-album-preview.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/26275-andee-blacksugar/videos/video/33-black-sugar-transmission-covers-madonnas-debut-album-preview.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<img src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/videos/26275/thumbs/cwoRUaT4LNe.jpg" alt="" />&nbsp;That's right, BST's newest album is a track-by-track interpretation of Madonna's classic 1983 debut record. It's also a tribute to the woman's entire career. 

Available soon on Black Sugar Transmission's Bandcamp page in a variety of high-quality digital formats.]]></description>
			<pubDate>Tue, 24 Apr 2012 06:55:48 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>MESSAGE TO MADONNA &amp;amp; GUY : WORLD TOUR 2012 SET LIST REQUEST VIDEO</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/24168-tony-tone-tone-albanese/videos/video/32-message-to-madonna-a-guy--world-tour-2012-set-list-request-video.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/24168-tony-tone-tone-albanese/videos/video/32-message-to-madonna-a-guy--world-tour-2012-set-list-request-video.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<img src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/videos/24168/thumbs/yw7isaiHtiN.jpg" alt="" />&nbsp;Hi Madonna &amp; Guy! Be sure to watch the last minute of this video and email us at OpenYourPIT@gmail.com. This is just a fun discussion about what songs we would love (or not love) to see on tour while you are hard at work rehearsing. It's nothing more than some constructive criticism :) Thanks and we can't wait to see the show in a few months! *We do not claim any ownership on anything in the video. http://www.facebook.com/madonnatour2012]]></description>
			<pubDate>Tue, 27 Mar 2012 01:40:35 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Forest Witch (Frida Freak)</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/26001--/videos/video/31-forest-witch-frida-freak.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/26001--/videos/video/31-forest-witch-frida-freak.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<img src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/videos/26001/thumbs/YKGuxiYd4Zb.jpg" alt="" />&nbsp;People are laughing calling her a forest witch. Ugly face. Crooked hands. She is haunting people like a scary ghost. Appearances are deceptive... Can you see the beauty in the beast? People say it`s impossible. Become a real human and try to do it... Fragile soul. Monster in disguise. She cries and hides her eyes from the sun. Trying to give her love. Useless love... Because it`s shine it is not visible. Do you recognize yourself in a mirror of eyes of a wood witch?

photo by - Coma Blair
model - Frida
MUA by - Coma Blair
costume &amp; outfit by - Frida
video by - Sergey (C_File)  
http://crackedfile.ru
http://fridafreak.ru

Лесная Ведьма
Люди смеются в глаза лесной ведьме. Безобразное лицо. Корявые пальцы. Призрак, вселяющий ужас. Внешность обманчива... Легко ли разглядеть красоту в чудовище? Люди скажут, что это невозможно, а ты стань человеком и попробуй... Хрупкая душа под личиной урода. Она плачет, скрывая глаза от солнца. Пытаясь подарить свою любовь, которая никому не нужна. Потому что её блеска не видно глазами. Узнаёшь ли себя в зеркале глаз лесной ведьмы?]]></description>
			<pubDate>Sun, 11 Mar 2012 01:31:54 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
