		<item>
			<title>Goodbye New York (written and performed by Vasiliy Komendant aka Brian 2K)</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/25335-brian/videos/video/28-goodbye-new-york-written-and-performed-by-vasiliy-komendant-aka-brian-2k.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/community/25335-brian/videos/video/28-goodbye-new-york-written-and-performed-by-vasiliy-komendant-aka-brian-2k.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<img src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/videos/25335/thumbs/I9QzswaLmWz.jpg" alt="" />&nbsp;My musical love confession to the City. There is no way I could ever truly say &quot;goodbye New York&quot; and mean it. I heart NY... May you flourish forever  in peace and splendour.

the song written and performed by Vasiliy Komendant aka Brian, produced by Victor Romanov]]></description>
			<pubDate>Mon, 23 Jan 2012 07:41:37 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
